WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.890
There is a growing awareness of the importance of digital literacy and skills in today’s world.
在当今世界，人们越来越意识到数字素养和技能的重要性。

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:18.800
From online shopping and mobile payments to remote work and virtual classes, digital technology has become part of almost every aspect of our lives.
从网上购物、移动支付到远程办公、在线课堂，数字技术几乎已经成为我们生活方方面面的一部分。

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.340
Digital literacy matters for several reasons.
数字素养之所以重要，有几方面的原因。

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:25.490
First, it is essential for study and work.
第一，它对学习和工作至关重要。

00:00:26.290 --> 00:00:36.180
Students need it to find reliable materials and use learning platforms, while employees increasingly rely on digital tools to communicate and solve problems.
学生需要它来查找可靠的资料、使用学习平台，而员工也越来越依赖数字工具来沟通和解决问题。

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:39.080
Second, it helps keep us safe online.
第二，它有助于保障我们的网络安全。

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:47.980
People with good digital literacy can recognize fraud, protect their personal information and tell trustworthy sources from misleading ones.
具备良好数字素养的人能够识别诈骗，保护个人信息，并分辨可信的信息来源和误导性的信息来源。

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:53.120
Third, it allows everyone to share the benefits of technological progress.
第三，它让每个人都能共享科技进步带来的好处。

00:00:53.920 --> 00:01:03.870
Without basic digital skills, for instance, many elderly people feel left behind because they cannot book a doctor’s appointment or buy a train ticket online.
例如，由于没有基本的数字技能，许多老年人无法在网上预约看病或购买火车票，因而觉得自己被时代落下了。

00:01:04.670 --> 00:01:16.490
To improve digital literacy, schools should offer courses on information skills and online safety, and communities can organize training sessions for elderly residents who struggle with smartphones.
为了提高数字素养，学校应开设信息技能和网络安全方面的课程，社区也可以为在使用智能手机方面有困难的老年居民组织培训。

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:23.000
As individuals, we should keep learning new digital skills while using technology wisely.
作为个人，我们应该在明智地使用技术的同时，不断学习新的数字技能。

00:01:23.800 --> 00:01:29.020
That is how we can truly benefit from the digital age instead of being overwhelmed by it.
这样，我们才能真正从数字时代中受益，而不是被它压垮。
